# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong's free cast may pay optional additional costs and chooses targets as any cast does (CR
# 601.2b-c, 118.9; the ruling: "you may pay any optional additional costs (such as kicker)"). Bot1 puts the Planetarium out
# on turn 1 (Sol Ring, Black Lotus, Mox Jet); Bot2 casts an Ornithopter on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 activates the
# Planetarium with Mox Pearl and scries 2, keeping Torch the Tower on top. Cast free, Torch the Tower is bargained -
# Bot1 sacrifices Mox Jet - and targets the Ornithopter: 3 damage, the Ornithopter is exiled instead of dying, and Bot1
# scries 1. That scry does not trigger the Planetarium again: a card was cast with it this turn (CR 603.2h).

